	(text "Each wiper has 10 nF to ground. The mux picks one pot (address 0-15 = RV1-RV16), a unity-gain buffer drives the 12-bit ADC.\nADC reference is AVDD, the same rail that feeds the pots, so readings are ratiometric."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
