	(text "Three 74HC165 in a chain. Pulse SR_LOAD low, then clock out 24 bits on SR_DATA: U5 D7 first ... U5 D0, U6 D7 ... D0, U7 D7 ... D0.\nEvery input has a 10 k pull-up, so pressed = 0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 36.83 0)
		(effects
